From 6a5c5929148d3b0e553e445ce7126df960a032de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:57:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] sp-read-aloud, and core's message card reads aloud and links
 to its start

Host-element vocabulary 1.5: `sp-read-aloud`, a host-drawn play/stop
toggle that reads its `text` in `speaker`'s voice with the viewer's own
speech voices (`speaker-name` names them in the viewer's settings). Grew
only; the shape is pinned under 1.5.

SessionMessage places it beside the quick actions (and in Folio's
controls), keyed by the line's speaker ref, and ends the content cell
with a "Back to the start of this message" link to `#message-<id>`.
New widget parts: messages.message-read-aloud, messages.message-jump.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XyR36mqP841S713w639TtH
